---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { EMAIL_URL, EMAIL_ADDRESS } from '../consts';
import imgSink from '../assets/work/new-pedestal-sink-installed.webp';
import imgFaucet from '../assets/work/new-kitchen-faucet-installed.webp';
import imgBathroom from '../assets/work/renovated-bathroom-bathtub.webp';
import imgCorridor from '../assets/work/renovation-corridor-mid-work.webp';
import imgStripped from '../assets/work/room-stripped-for-renovation.webp';
import imgBathMid from '../assets/work/bathroom-mid-renovation.webp';
import imgWasher from '../assets/work/washing-machine-installed.webp';
import imgFridge from '../assets/work/refrigerator-installed.webp';

const workPhotos = [
  { src: imgCorridor, alt: 'A coliving house corridor mid-renovation, floors stripped back and doors off, with tools on the ground', label: 'Corridor, mid-renovation' },
  { src: imgStripped, alt: 'A room stripped back to bare walls during renovation, with paint tins and materials on the floor', label: 'Room, stripped back' },
  { src: imgBathMid, alt: 'A bathroom during renovation with a newly fitted basin, exposed pipework and a hose on the tiled floor', label: 'Bathroom, during' },
  { src: imgSink, alt: 'A new pedestal sink installed in a Korean bathroom', label: 'Bathroom sink, replaced' },
  { src: imgBathroom, alt: 'A fully renovated bathroom with a bathtub, new tiling and shower set', label: 'Bathroom, renovated' },
  { src: imgFaucet, alt: 'A newly installed kitchen faucet with a flexible hose on a black sink', label: 'Kitchen faucet, replaced' },
  { src: imgWasher, alt: 'A washing machine installed in a coliving house laundry space, with flowers set on top', label: 'Washing machine, installed' },
  { src: imgFridge, alt: 'A refrigerator installed in a coliving house kitchen', label: 'Refrigerator, installed' },
];

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'AboutPage',
  name: 'About Balli Balli Seoul',
  url: 'https://balliballi.com/about/',
  mainEntity: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'Balli Balli Seoul',
    legalName: '지인어스 (Jiinus)',
    url: 'https://balliballi.com/',
    logo: 'https://balliballi.com/favicon.svg',
    founder: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Yeonbum Kim' },
    areaServed: { '@type': 'City', name: 'Seoul' },
    contactPoint: {
      '@type': 'ContactPoint',
      contactType: 'customer service',
      email: 'balliballiseoul@gmail.com',
      availableLanguage: ['English', 'Korean'],
    },
    taxID: '108-24-44405',
  },
};
---

<Base
  title="About Us — Balli Balli Seoul"
  description="We ran coliving houses in Seoul, and helping our foreign residents with life’s breakdowns became a service. That service ended on 11 November 2026. Here’s who we were and how it worked."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />

  <article class="about">
    <h1>We started this because our housemates kept knocking</h1>

    <p>
      Balli Balli Seoul grew out of something very concrete: <strong>we run
      coliving houses in Seoul</strong>, shared homes where foreign residents
      and students live. When you live under the same roof as people new to
      Korea, you become the default fixer — the person they find when the
      drain clogs, the checkout page won't take a foreign card, or something
      needs cleaning, explaining, or arguing about in Korean. We did that,
      over and over, for years.
    </p>

    <p>
      Building those houses taught us the other half of the job. We renovated
      them ourselves — working side by side with the wallpaper crews, flooring
      installers, carpenters, and electricians who actually keep Seoul's homes
      running. That's where our network of tradespeople comes from: not a
      directory, but people we've stood next to on real jobs. And it's where
      we learned exactly how much of this world runs on Korean phone calls,
      Korean apps, and knowing who to ask — which is precisely the part
      that's closed to you if you don't speak the language. Balli Balli Seoul
      is that access, opened up.
    </p>

    <h2>How it worked</h2>

    <p class="ended-note">
      <strong>This service ended on 11 November 2026.</strong> Nothing below is bookable
      any more — it is kept here as a record of what we did.
      <a href="/blog/notice-all-services-ended/">Read the notice</a>.
    </p>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>You messaged us in English</strong> — on KakaoTalk or WhatsApp, with
        photos of the problem. KakaoTalk was the one we preferred: it is what the
        plumbers, locksmiths and cleaners we called were already using, so your photos
        and address went straight through to them instead of being retyped between apps.
        Asking cost nothing — you paid only for the work you booked. Both lines are
        now closed.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>We diagnosed and quoted.</strong> We told you what it was, what it
        should cost, and what the options were. The price was confirmed with you in
        the chat before any work started.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>We handled it.</strong> Depending on the job, we either took care of
        it ourselves or sent a specialist from our network who was good at exactly
        that work — while we stayed in the middle, in English, from start to finish.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p>
      And it was not only repairs. Errands counted too — something bought, filed,
      picked up, or sorted out in Korean. Our fee was built into the price we
      confirmed with you, agreed before work started, with no surprises after.
    </p>

    <h2>The work</h2>

    <p>
      Words are cheap, so here's some of the actual work — the renovation and
      repairs on our own coliving houses, done and managed by us. Stripped
      floors and bare walls first, finished rooms after. This is the
      apprenticeship the service is built on:
    </p>

    <div class="work-grid">
      {workPhotos.map((p) => (
        <figure>
          <Image src={p.src} alt={p.alt} width={520} densities={[1, 2]} />
          <figcaption>{p.label} · ⓒ @BalliBalliSeoul</figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h2>The company</h2>

    <p>
      Balli Balli Seoul is operated by <strong>Jiinus (지인어스)</strong>, a
      registered Korean business.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Representative: Yeonbum Kim</li>
      <li>Business registration: 108-24-44405</li>
      <li>E-commerce registration: 2025-서울중구-143</li>
      <li>Service area: Seoul</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      While the service ran we were a booking and coordination business: we
      connected you with independent local providers and confirmed all terms with
      you before work began — the full notice is in the footer of every page.
    </p>

    <aside class="cta">
      <p>
        <strong>The service has ended, but the writing stays.</strong> Over a hundred
        guides to living in Seoul — what things cost, who to call, what the Korean
        word on the screen means — are still online and free to read.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog/" class="cta-btn">Browse the guides →</a>
      <a href={EMAIL_URL} class="cta-btn email">✉️ {EMAIL_ADDRESS}</a>
    </aside>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  h1{font-size:clamp(26px,4.6vw,40px);line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:24px}
  h2{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin:36px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .about p{margin:14px 0}
  .about ol,.about ul{margin:14px 0;padding-left:26px}
  .about li{margin:8px 0}
  .about a{color:var(--primary-dark);font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .work-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:20px 0}
  .work-grid figure{margin:0}
  .work-grid img{width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px}
  .work-grid figcaption{margin-top:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}
  @media(max-width:640px){.work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.work-grid img{height:auto}}
  .cta{background:var(--primary-light);border:2px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;margin-top:44px;font-size:15px}
  .ended-note{background:#fef3c7;border:2px solid #fcd34d;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px 16px;font-size:14.5px;margin:0 0 18px}
  .ended-note a{color:#92400e;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .cta-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;margin-right:10px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff !important;font-weight:800;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none !important}
  .cta-btn.email{background:var(--email);color:#fff !important}
  .cta-btn:hover{filter:brightness(.95)}
</style>
